---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Eric Nolan: technical product management, engineering, release delivery, trustworthy AI systems, and practical building."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Product judgment grounded in engineering.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        My background spans software engineering, performance engineering, enterprise release delivery, and technical product management. My current public work focuses heavily on making AI-assisted systems more controllable, inspectable, and useful.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell prose">
      <h2>What I optimize for</h2>
      <p>
        Credibility, maintainability, explicit tradeoffs, bounded authority, and systems that fail in understandable ways. I am less interested in maximizing autonomy than in using the right amount of automation for the job.
      </p>

      <h2>Public-safe by design</h2>
      <p>
        This site documents personal projects, public reference implementations, and general professional experience. Employer code, data, credentials, confidential implementations, and proprietary details are intentionally excluded.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
